+6-digit code per preset, 10-min TTL, single-use). Login returns a short-TTL
+HS256 JWT (`App\Support\TotemJwt`, secret/TTL from `services.totem`); the
+three data endpoints re-validate totem + preset activity and entity
+consistency on every call and scope queues to JWT-claims ∩ the preset's
+current join. Ticket issuance reuses the domain action
+`App\Actions\IssueTicket` (channel `totem`); priority levels are
+backend-owned (`App\Support\TotemPriorities`). Device authentication is
+represented by the `totems` / `totem_presets` models. The API never trusts
+a client-provided entity, queue ownership, price, ticket priority, or
+payment state without server-side validation.
+
